{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111950","id":2940473392,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vRBAw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111950","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111950.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111950.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111950","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111950/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111950/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111950/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c236ebe901fca6a4cd5d8870a29c53aeda2fa28e","number":111950,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Reorder registration of some classes in `main.cpp`","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"* Prepares for #106873\r\n\r\nOn `master`, when running the godot executable, multiple class registration warnings appear. \r\nSome of these, which this PR focuses on, need to have their registration happen earlier than was currently the case. The changes in this PR are a bit more involved. \r\n\r\n* `register_early_scene_types` and `register_early_editor_types` were added as they were the most minimal change I figured out that would fix the registration order issues for `MultiplayerPeer` and `EditorPaths`/`EditorTranslationParserPlugin` respectively. \r\n* FBX module delayed to initialize after GLTF module since it needs some of its classes. \r\n  * I wanted to reorder the module initialization order list itself, but looking at the SCons section responsible for generating the module initialization file, it is currently just an alphabetic order generation. Modifying this to be a custom order would be more involved and more prone to breaking than delaying the module initialization. \r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\nAdd `register_early_scene_types` and move `MultiplayerPeer` registration \r\nNeeds to happen before `intialize_websocket_module()` which is called through `initialize_modules()`\r\n\r\nAdd missing `ThemeContext` registration and reorder `ThemeDB` & `ThemeContext` before instantiation\r\n\r\ndelay fbx module initialization to Editor phase\r\nIt needs GLTF module initialized first which is done in the Scene phase, before the Editor phase\r\n\r\nAdd `register_early_editor_types` and move `EditorPaths` registration Needs to happen before `EditorPaths::create()`\r\n`EditorTranslationParserPlugin` moved to early phase too\r\n</details>\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:bu